98, "fontSize": 7.5}, {"text": "they", "x": 31.9, "y": 26.74, "w": 2.9, "h": 0.98, "fontSize": 7.5}, {"text": "will", "x": 34.8, "y": 26.74, "w": 2.42, "h": 0.98, "fontSize": 7.5}, {"text": "realise", "x": 37.22, "y": 26.74, "w": 4.31, "h": 0.98, "fontSize": 7.5}, {"text": "I am no fruit-", "x": 41.53, "y": 26.74, "w": 8.4, "h": 0.98, "fontSize": 7.5}, {"text": "cake.", "x": 29.64, "y": 27.97, "w": 3.57, "h": 0.98, "fontSize": 7.5}, {"text": "Comment", "x": 58.27, "y": 4.38, "w": 9.26, "h": 1.74, "fontSize": 12.9}, {"text": "Could these phenomena", "x": 52.33, "y": 6.35, "w": 19.5, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "be connected? Could all", "x": 52.36, "y": 7.56, "w": 19.36, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "the sightings be off the", "x": 52.3, "y": 8.77, "w": 18.06, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "same craft or craffts", "x": 52.36, "y": 9.98, "w": 16.06, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "observed on separate", "x": 52.33, "y": 11.19, "w": 17.49, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "days? If this is the case", "x": 52.33, "y": 12.4, "w": 19.04, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "then we seem to be in the", "x": 52.3, "y": 13.61, "w": 20.99, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "middle of a 'UFO flap'. It's", "x": 52.36, "y": 14.82, "w": 20.54, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "thanks to witnesses like", "x": 52.3, "y": 16.03, "w": 19.62, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "these who know they", "x": 52.3, "y": 17.24, "w": 17.22, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "have seen something", "x": 52.36, "y": 18.45, "w": 17.19, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "unusual, and have the", "x": 52.36, "y": 19.66, "w": 17.82, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "mind to report and", "x": 52.36, "y": 20.87, "w": 15.03, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "respond to others asking", "x": 52.36, "y": 22.08, "w": 19.99, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "for information and then", "x": 52.3, "y": 23.29, "w": 19.54, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "thanks to keen reporters", "x": 52.3, "y": 24.5, "w": 19.93, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "on local newspapers for", "x": 52.33, "y": 25.71, "w": 19.26, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "getting their editors to", "x": 52.33, "y": 26.92, "w": 18.07, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "publish such stories.", "x": 52.36, "y": 28.13, "w": 16.67, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "have reported seeing", "x": 52.36, "y": 31.97, "w": 17.04, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "these strange unidentified", "x": 52.3, "y": 33.18, "w": 21.12, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "objects, then one has to", "x": 52.33, "y": 34.4, "w": 19.38, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "wonder how many others", "x": 52.33, "y": 35.61, "w": 20.35, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "saw something but thought", "x": 52.36, "y": 36.82, "w": 21.29, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "better of making their ob-", "x": 52.36, "y": 38.03, "w": 19.95, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "servations known. Perhaps", "x": 52.36, "y": 39.24, "w": 21.24, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "we will never know.", "x": 52.33, "y": 40.45, "w": 15.94, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "Stories like these should", "x": 74.99, "y": 5.16, "w": 19.84, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "be of great interest to", "x": 74.99, "y": 6.37, "w": 17.58, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "both the public and to the", "x": 74.99, "y": 7.58, "w": 20.71, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "authorities. Perhaps if", "x": 74.96, "y": 8.79, "w": 17.8, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "they were published in a", "x": 74.93, "y": 10.0, "w": 19.77, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "straight forward manner", "x": 74.99, "y": 11.21, "w": 19.6, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "as with the", "x": 74.99, "y": 12.42, "w": 8.72, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "Tamworth", "x": 83.71, "y": 12.6, "w": 8.05, "h": 1.13, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "Herald's", "x": 74.96, "y": 13.81, "w": 5.19, "h": 1.13, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "report and not", "x": 81.79, "y": 13.63, "w": 11.66, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "spiced up or branded into", "x": 74.99, "y": 14.84, "w": 20.6, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "the 'Wacky World of UFOs'", "x": 74.93, "y": 16.05, "w": 20.97, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "(such is the label given to", "x": 75.05, "y": 17.26, "w": 20.66, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "the BBC Time Watch pro-", "x": 74.93, "y": 18.47, "w": 19.62, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "gramme aired earlier this", "x": 74.96, "y": 19.68, "w": 20.57, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "month) then readers and", "x": 74.99, "y": 20.89, "w": 20.03, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "witnesses alike should be", "x": 74.96, "y": 22.1, "w": 20.87, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "able to give this subject", "x": 74.99, "y": 23.31, "w": 19.25, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "the respect and investiga-", "x": 74.96, "y": 24.52, "w": 20.47, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "tion it deserves.", "x": 74.93, "y": 25.73, "w": 13.05, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "Russel Callaghan", "x": 86.81, "y": 27.5, "w": 9.41, "h": 0.92, "fontSize": 5.5}, {"text": "Name and", "x": 34.33, "y": 30.44, "w": 6.32, "h": 0.98, "fontSize": 7.5}, {"text": "address supplied", "x": 40.65, "y": 30.44, "w": 11.24, "h": 0.98, "fontSize": 7.5}, {"text": "If four or five individuals", "x": 52.36, "y": 30.76, "w": 19.29, "h": 1.41, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "17", "x": 94.3, "y": 97.5, "w": 2.19, "h": 1.27, "fontSize": 9.5}]}